# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Conditional statement
   Changed the unconditional assignment `self.hidden_index = True` to branch-specific behavior based on whether `subset` is `None`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Assignment statement: set `self.hidden_index` to `True`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Conditional branch: when `subset is None`, set `self.hide_index_` to `True`;
   * `else` branch: construct `subset_` from `subset`, update `subset`, obtain `hide` through `self.data.loc[subset]`, obtain `hrows` through `self.index.get_indexer_for(hide.index)`, and assign `hrows` to `self.hidden_rows`.
# /detail
# mode：Modify control-flow structure (add conditional branch)
